DEFINE_UI_TOOLTIP(uiInput, "What this node receives. In a DaVinci Wide Gamut colour managed project choose DaVinci WG Intermediate. Negative Cineon Log prints a negative made by another MC Film Core node (Output: Negative Cineon Log) - set the same Negative Stock on both.")
